x, object.y, object.width, object.height)\n    end\nend\n```\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/label-lua#label.get_layout_objects:url)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:label.get_layout_objects","jsName":"getLayoutObjects","line":41,"member":"get_layout_objects","modulePath":["label"],"overloads":[],"parameters":[{"description":"the label to inspect","optional":false,"rawName":"url","rawType":"string|hash|url"}],"rawName":"label.get_layout_objects","returnDescriptions":["objects layout objects in source order"],"returns":["label.layout_object[]"],"runtimeStatus":"requires-universal-lua-bridge","source":"doc/label.lua"},{"description":"Gets the text from a label component\n\nThis function is deprecated. Use `go.get(\"#label\", \"text\")` instead.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```lua\nfunction init(self)\n    local text = go.get(\"#label\", \"text\")\n    print(text)\nend\n```\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/label-lua#label.get_text:url)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:label.get_text","jsName":"getText","line":59,"member":"get_text","modulePath":["label"],"overloads":[],"parameters":[{"description":"the label to get the text from","optional":false,"rawName":"url","rawType":"string|hash|url"}],"rawName":"label.get_text","returnDescriptions":["text the label text"],"returns":["string"],"runtimeStatus":"requires-universal-lua-bridge","source":"doc/label.lua"},{"description":"Maps each glyph cluster onto an ordered cubic Bezier chain in local space.\nAll text lines use the same curve, offset by their baseline distance along up.\nEach knot has position, optional in_handle/out_handle offsets, roll_degrees\n(default zero), and positive uniform scale (default one).\nOnly the first knot accepts up, the initial direction to transport along the\ncurve. It defaults to {0, 1, 0}; its length does not affect scale. Vectors can\nbe vector3 values or {x, y, z} tables. Handles default to zero offsets.\nA curve overrides arc and size. Line Break wraps at the curve's length.\nOpen endpoints extrapolate their tangents. Passing nil restores arc/textbox mapping.\nEach call copies and bakes the knots; call again when the path changes.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```lua\nlabel.set_curve(\"#label\", {\n    {position = {0, 0, 0}, out_handle = {80, 80, 0}, up = {0, 1, 0}},\n    {position = {240, 0, 0}, in_handle = {-80, -80, 0}, roll_degrees = 30, scale = 1.2},\n})\n```\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/label-lua#label.set_curve:url-knots-options)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:label.set_curve","jsName":"setCurve","line":85,"member":"set_curve","modulePath":["label"],"overloads":[],"parameters":[{"description":"label component","optional":false,"rawName":"url","rawType":"string|hash|url"},{"description":"ordered array of at least two knots, or nil to clear","optional":true,"rawName":"knots","rawType":"{ position:vector3|number[], in_handle?:vector3|number[], out_handle?:vector3|number[], up?:vector3|number[], roll_degrees?:number, scale?:number }[]|nil"},{"description":"optional table with closed (boolean, default false)","optional":true,"rawName":"options","rawType":"{ closed?:boolean }"}],"rawName":"label.set_curve","returnDescriptions":[],"returns":[],"runtimeStatus":"requires-universal-lua-bridge","source":"doc/label.lua"},{"description":"Sets the text of a label component\n\nThis function is deprecated. Use `go.set(\"#label\", \"text\", value)` instead.\n\nThis method uses the message passing that means the value will be set after `dispatch messages` step.\nMore information is available in the [Application Lifecycle manual](/manuals/application-lifecycle).\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```lua\nfunction init(self)\n    go.set(\"#label\", \"text\", \"Hello World!\")\nend\n```\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/label-lua#label.set_text:url-text)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:label.set_text","jsName":"setText","